It is Tuesday evening.
It is half past five.
I am at the gym now.
I always exercise on Tuesdays and Thursdays.
I do not exercise every day.
The gym is very full today.
Many people exercise after work.
I start with the workout.
First, I run a little.
Then I do my strength training.
I exercise for exactly one hour.
The exercises are sometimes hard.
But the workout is good for me.
Now it is half past six.
I am finished.
I drink a lot of water.
Then I go home.
It is February and it is very cold outside.
But my flat is warm.
The evening is quiet now.
